  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f1c4a8975e7e765d",
      "translationZh": "参见此处，或阅读以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1d0027196ca20e77",
      "translationZh": "我找到了这个变通方案/完整配置方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c05ea48105022a4",
      "translationZh": "（最后这条命令会引发与此问题相关的错误，因为安装的是 mcp v2）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f0ce5040314ea71",
      "translationZh": "（现在 mcp 服务器又能正常工作了）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ee281e30adc4e8a8",
      "translationZh": "在 llama-server webui 中，即通常在浏览器中访问 http://localhost:8080 或 http://localhost:9931（最新 llama.cpp 的默认 webui 端口）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4f3a950a72fb6b7",
      "translationZh": "像往常一样启动 llama-server，加载你偏好的模型和设置，并添加 --ui-mcp-proxy 选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50c72f7c5e170f93",
      "translationZh": "点击大号 +（聊天编辑框下方）> mcp 服务器 > 输入服务器 URL http://127.0.0.1:9191，然后勾选“使用 llama-server 代理”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "78abcd091486a81b",
      "translationZh": "另外，要安装与上面已启用的 mcp 服务器通信的配套插件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a531bc79a683d4bf",
      "translationZh": "编辑 > 偏好设置 > 系统 > 允许在线访问",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d1986d87e1f691b",
      "translationZh": "编辑 > 偏好设置 > 插件 > V > 从磁盘安装",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "004cee61a2072bcb",
      "translationZh": "导航到刚创建的 zip 文件所在的路径，并选择该文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "665206a50223998b",
      "translationZh": "启动插件（不要将其端口从默认的 9876 改为其他值）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "427d878c73a157f2",
      "translationZh": "如果尚未设置场景，就创建一个新的空场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "22407892c56dc9fd",
      "translationZh": "返回 llama-server 网页界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "045ba734384e3bdd",
      "translationZh": "在聊天输入框中输入类似这样的内容：“在 blender 中，在一片草地上创建一栋简单的房子，房子旁边有一棵树，房子前面有一辆汽车，调整相机，让所有物体都能恰当地纳入画面”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79e381b90f0c1f8c",
      "translationZh": "（授权后续的 exec_blender_stuff 请求，或进入设置 > 工具 > blender mcp，勾选所有授权复选框）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fbc97307c282b9f",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/DevelopmentBorn3978 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
